# GET /received — step 1: list what the source has pulled so far.
#
# The `received` namespace holds one key per message the _source stack
# recorded (keyed by @source.key). kv/list returns that namespace's
# keys, a page at a time — the KV namespace IS the prefix, so there is
# no per-key scan. count + keys are the proof the watch loop ran.
WHEN @src == "http" && @web.req.method == "GET" && @web.req.url.path == "/received"
  EXEC "txco://kv/list"
    WITH namespace = "received",
         into = "._recv"
